issue_context.body:
System.Char currently defines a [private `IsAscii` method](https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/blob/d8ca3562358b036afc14c6f1abc517154c98b095/src/libraries/System.Private.CoreLib/src/System/Char.cs#L82). It think it might make sense to make this public?

```diff
public readonly struct Char
{
+  public static bool IsAscii(char ch);
}
```

